  "source_text": "Order of the Burning Spear Home Europe Asia America Africa Oceania Links Back Tags list Allies Research Back Societies Forums Back All updates Album sheets Reference Catalogue Search Order of the Burning Spear Order instituted on 21 April 1966. Order awarded for services to Republic of Kenya. Order have three classes: Chief of the Burning Spear ( C.B.S.), Elder of the Burning Spear ( E.B.S.) and Moran of the Burning Spear ( M.B.S.). Kenya Previous article: Order of the Golden Heart Prev Next article: Long Service and Good Conduct Medal Next ©\n    2007 -     2026\n    Ilja Repetski",
